        "id": 56475,
        "name": "Zalrus9",
        "username": "Zalrus9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/zalrus9/{size}/2124_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-02T02:44:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"lynkfox\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/48/1997_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lynkfox:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On Topic:TL Tach has 169 games (most of allt he promo heroes cards, though less than any standard hero card) and an 85% win rate, easily topping the spread (excluding Greatest Legacy which only has 20something games)&nbsp;Yes. She is /powerful/ for winning the game by boosting her teammates. Card Draw=Superior</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That makes sense! She, much like the Legacies, is a force multiplier. Since a&nbsp;<em>lot&nbsp;</em>of heroes have really cool combos, Team Leader Tachyion allows that to happen on a massive scale. Then, once those engines are out, then she can start dealing damage.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, I kind of like that promo art better…</p>\n<p>SHE SUPPORTS THE OCULUS RIFT!!!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
