        "created_at": "2013-04-06T02:10:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jchavez\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/9de0a6/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jchavez:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I agree that she's a little overpowered. Another idea to tone her down a little bit: \"You and another hero draw a card.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I like it.</p>",
